This document describes overlays provided in the kernel packages
For generic Armbian overlays documentation please see
https://docs.armbian.com/Hardware_Allwinner_overlays/

### Platform:

sun55i-t527 (Allwinner A523/T527)

### Provided overlays:

- npu

### Overlay details:

### npu

Enables the Vivante NPU on T527 boards whose base device tree keeps it
disabled, such as the industrial Radxa Cubie A5E. The A527 used on the
standard Cubie A5E has no NPU, so do not enable it there.

To use it, add to /boot/armbianEnv.txt:

    overlays=npu
